            "text": "I’ll build isolated test fixtures so the original data stays untouched. The main compatibility checks are unsigned balance arithmetic, duplicate records, buyer and seller being the same account, and how short records affect reads and rewrites.\n"
          }
        ],
        "phase": "commentary",
